{"id":"c75a86bee179cecd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-cut-elimination.md","title":"Cut Elimination","display":"df-cut-elimination — Cut Elimination","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-cut-elimination","aliases":["72-df-cut-elimination"],"display":"df-cut-elimination — Cut Elimination","depends_on":["[[72-df-cut-rule]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.2 print37/PDF49","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-cut-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-cut-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-elimination — Cut Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a94e54a928b642a\" href=\"?note=2a94e54a928b642a\" title=\"72-df-cut-rule\">72-df-cut-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.2 print37/PDF49"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 为固定无切基础演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{cut}\">\\(\\mathsf{cut}\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf R\\)</span> 的标签中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、演算扩充和有限证明集分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a94e54a928b642a\" href=\"?note=2a94e54a928b642a\" title=\"72-df-cut-rule\">72-df-cut-rule</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutElim}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal C):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma}\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CutElim}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal C):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma}\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基础演算、Cut扩充及合法证明域均为实际集合。LJ只加入所有相继式都在其结论空间中的Cut实例；以下把C+Cut理解为该结论空间上的限制，见Gentzen-system。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypoth